OL,3,AUK diesel price close to all-time high
OL,4,
OL,5,FDiesel prices in the UK are expected to
OL,6,Fhit record levels over the weekend as
OL,7,Fthe fallout from the US-Israel war with
OL,8,FIran continues to drive up costs.
OL,10,FThe average price of a litre of diesel
OL,11,Fat the pump stands at 198.32p,
OL,12,Faccording to the RAC motoring body.
OL,13,FThat's close to the all-time high of
OL,14,F199.09p recorded on 25 June 2022,
OL,15,Ffollowing Russia's full-scale invasion
OL,16,Fof Ukraine.
OL,23,APub: 02-MarQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
