OL,3,AUK diesel price close to all-time high
OL,4,
OL,5,FSimon Williams, head of policy at RAC,
OL,6,Fsaid the June 2022 high would "almost
OL,7,Fcertainly be surpassed over the weekend
OL,8,Fas retailers continue to pass on the
OL,9,Fincreases they're seeing when they buy
OL,10,Fnew supply".
OL,12,FOver the past seven months, the Iran
OL,13,Fwar has severely disrupted the
OL,14,Fproduction and transportation of
OL,15,Fwholesale oil across the region,
OL,16,Fcausing the price of fuels made from
OL,17,Foil to surge.
OL,23,APub: 02-MarQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
